<fw type="header" place="top">III. Die Volksbetriebsamkeit.</fw>
<ab type="heading" xml:id="p240-b1" facs="#f0252-b1"><lb n="1" facs="#f0252-l1"/>Umfang und Vertheilung der <rs type="concept" ref="#concept-wald">Wälder</rs>.<lb/><lb n="2" facs="#f0252-l2"/>a) Ueberhaupt in preußischen Morgen:</ab>
<table xml:id="p240-b2" facs="#f0252-b2" rows="8" cols="16"><row role="label"><cell role="label">Landestheile.</cell><cell role="label">Kammerforste. Laub.</cell><cell role="label">Kammerforste. Nadel.</cell><cell role="label">Kammerforste. Sa.</cell><cell role="label">Gemeindeforste. Laub.</cell><cell role="label">Gemeindeforste. Nadel.</cell><cell role="label">Gemeindeforste. Sa.</cell><cell role="label">Stiftungsforste. Laub.</cell><cell role="label">Stiftungsforste. Nadel.</cell><cell role="label">Stiftungsforste. Sa.</cell><cell role="label">Privatwald. Laub.</cell><cell role="label">Privatwald. Nadel.</cell><cell role="label">Privatwald. Sa.</cell><cell role="label">Gesammtareal. Laub.</cell><cell role="label">Gesammtareal. Nadel.</cell><cell role="label">Gesammtareal. Summa.</cell></row><row><cell><placeName ref="#place-gera">Gera</placeName></cell><cell>849</cell><cell>3571</cell><cell>4420</cell><cell>120</cell><cell>1196</cell><cell>1316</cell><cell>124</cell><cell>257</cell><cell>381</cell><cell>4701</cell><cell>10480</cell><cell>15191</cell><cell>5794</cell><cell>15504</cell><cell>21298</cell></row><row><cell>Pfl. <placeName ref="#place-reichenfels">Reichenfels</placeName></cell><cell>17</cell><cell>10500</cell><cell>10517</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>13</cell><cell>13</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>2</cell><cell>2</cell><cell>41</cell><cell>3492</cell><cell>3533</cell><cell>58</cell><cell>14007</cell><cell>14065</cell></row><row><cell>Herrsch. <placeName ref="#place-schleiz">Schleiz</placeName></cell><cell>172</cell><cell>12237</cell><cell>12409</cell><cell>14</cell><cell>451</cell><cell>465</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>899</cell><cell>899</cell><cell>90</cell><cell>15089</cell><cell>15179</cell><cell>276</cell><cell>28676</cell><cell>28952</cell></row><row><cell>Pfl. <placeName ref="#place-saalburg">Saalburg</placeName></cell><cell>10</cell><cell>5317</cell><cell>5327</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>387</cell><cell>387</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>310</cell><cell>310</cell><cell>12</cell><cell>5128</cell><cell>5140</cell><cell>22</cell><cell>11142</cell><cell>11164</cell></row><row><cell><placeName ref="#place-schleiz">Schleiz</placeName></cell><cell>199</cell><cell>28054</cell><cell>28253</cell><cell>14</cell><cell>851</cell><cell>865</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>1211</cell><cell>1211</cell><cell>143</cell><cell>23709</cell><cell>23852</cell><cell>356</cell><cell>53825</cell><cell>54181</cell></row><row><cell><placeName ref="#place-bezirk-lobenstein-ebersdorf">Lob.-Ebersd.</placeName></cell><cell>1037</cell><cell>30057</cell><cell>31094</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>719</cell><cell>719</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>417</cell><cell>417</cell><cell>109</cell><cell>25817</cell><cell>25926</cell><cell>1146</cell><cell>57010</cell><cell>58156</cell></row><row><cell>Fürstenthum*)</cell><cell>2085</cell><cell>61682</cell><cell>63767</cell><cell>134</cell><cell>2766</cell><cell>2900</cell><cell>124</cell><cell>1885</cell><cell>2009</cell><cell>4953</cell><cell>60006</cell><cell>64959</cell><cell>7296</cell><cell>126339</cell><cell>133635</cell></row></table>
<ab type="heading" xml:id="p240-b3" facs="#f0252-b3"><lb n="25" facs="#f0252-l25"/>b) Vergleichung der <rs type="concept" ref="#concept-wald">Wälder</rs> nach Procenten, Raum, Bevölkerung und nach <lb n="26" facs="#f0252-l26"/>dem Besitzstande:</ab>
<table xml:id="p240-b4" facs="#f0252-b4" rows="8" cols="8"><row role="label"><cell role="label">Landestheile.</cell><cell role="label">In Procenten. Laub.</cell><cell role="label">In Procenten. Nadel.</cell><cell role="label">In Procenten. Summe.</cell><cell role="label">Auf die Landesth. kommt Wald in □ M.</cell><cell role="label">Auf 1 Einw. kommen Morgen.</cell><cell role="label">Der Gesammtwald. Der Besitzstand.</cell><cell role="label">Der Gesammtwald. In Proc.</cell></row><row><cell><placeName ref="#place-gera">Gera</placeName></cell><cell>79,41</cell><cell>12,27</cell><cell>15,94</cell><cell>0,99</cell><cell>0,59</cell><cell>Stiftungswald</cell><cell>1,50</cell></row><row><cell>Pfl. <placeName ref="#place-reichenfels">Reichenfels</placeName></cell><cell>0,79</cell><cell>11,09</cell><cell>10,52</cell><cell>0,65</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>Gemeindewald</cell><cell>2,15</cell></row><row><cell>Herrsch. <placeName ref="#place-schleiz">Schleiz</placeName></cell><cell>3,77</cell><cell>22,70</cell><cell>21,66</cell><cell>1,34</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>Privatwald</cell><cell>48,23</cell></row><row><cell>Pfl. <placeName ref="#place-saalburg">Saalburg</placeName></cell><cell>0,32</cell><cell>8,81</cell><cell>8,36</cell><cell>0,52</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>Domainenwald</cell><cell>48,12</cell></row><row><cell><placeName ref="#place-schleiz">Schleiz</placeName></cell><cell>4,88</cell><cell>42,60</cell><cell>40,54</cell><cell>2,51</cell><cell>1,98</cell><cell></cell><cell></cell></row><row><cell><placeName ref="#place-bezirk-lobenstein-ebersdorf">Lob.-Ebersdorf</placeName> .</cell><cell>15,71</cell><cell>45,13</cell><cell>43,52</cell><cell>2,70</cell><cell>2,60</cell><cell></cell><cell></cell></row><row><cell>Fürstenthum</cell><cell>100</cell><cell>100</cell><cell>100</cell><cell>6,20</cell><cell>1,52</cell><cell></cell><cell>100</cell></row></table>
<p xml:id="p240-b5"><lb n="35" facs="#f0252-l35"/>Der Wald bedeckt demnach 41 1/5 Procent der Oberfläche des Landes und <lb n="36" facs="#f0252-l36"/>zwar mit 38,95 Procent <rs type="concept" ref="#concept-nadelwald">Nadelwald</rs> und mit 2,25 Procent <rs type="concept" ref="#concept-laubwald">Laubwald</rs>. Am <lb n="37" facs="#f0252-l37"/>Meisten ist der Landestheil <placeName ref="#place-bezirk-lobenstein-ebersdorf">Lobenstein-Ebersdorf</placeName> bewaldet, am Geringsten <placeName ref="#place-gera">Gera</placeName>. <lb n="38" facs="#f0252-l38"/>Das Stiftungs-Waldgut ist im Ganzen gering, am Stärksten noch im schleizer <lb n="39" facs="#f0252-l39"/>Landestheile. Nicht viel größer ist das Gemeinde-Waldgut, das größtentheils <lb n="40" facs="#f0252-l40"/>den städtischen Communen zukommt. Die Privatwaldungen und der Domainen<lb n="41" break="no" facs="#f0252-l41"/>wald stehen sich an Areal fast gleich, beide am Schwächsten im Unterlande, am <lb n="42" facs="#f0252-l42"/>Stärksten in <placeName ref="#place-bezirk-lobenstein-ebersdorf">Lobenstein-Ebersdorf</placeName>. Von den Privatwaldungen gehören 5872 1/2 <lb n="43" facs="#f0252-l43"/>Morgen oder 9 Procent den Rittergütern, 91 Procent den bäuerlichen Grund<lb n="44" break="no" facs="#f0252-l44"/>besitzern. Der Domainenwald umfaßt folgende Forsteien: 1) im Landestheile <lb n="45" facs="#f0252-l45"/><placeName ref="#place-gera">Gera</placeName> <placeName ref="#place-ernsee">Ernsee</placeName>, <placeName ref="#place-niederndorf">Niederndorf</placeName>, <placeName ref="#place-kleinaga">Kleinaga</placeName> und <placeName ref="#place-tinz">Tinz</placeName> mit 0,70; in <placeName ref="#place-schleiz">Schleiz</placeName> <placeName ref="#place-poellwitz">Pöllwitz</placeName>, <lb n="46" facs="#f0252-l46"/><placeName ref="#place-neuaergerniss">Neuärgerniß</placeName>, <placeName ref="#place-weckersdorf">Weckersdorf</placeName>, <placeName ref="#place-wuestendittersdorf">Wüstendittersdorf</placeName>, <placeName ref="#place-oberboehmsdorf">Oberböhmsdorf</placeName>, <placeName ref="#place-oberoschitz">Oberoschiß</placeName>, <placeName ref="#place-graefenwarth">Grä<lb n="47" break="no" facs="#f0252-l47"/>fenwarth</placeName>, <placeName ref="#place-dittersdorf">Dittersdorf</placeName>, <placeName ref="#place-saalburg">Saalburg</placeName> und <placeName ref="#place-tanna">Tanna</placeName> mit 44,31 und in <placeName ref="#place-bezirk-lobenstein-ebersdorf">Lobenstein-<lb n="48" facs="#f0252-l48"/>Ebersdorf</placeName> Ebersdorf, Lobenstein, <placeName ref="#place-harra">Harra</placeName>, <placeName ref="#place-heinrichsgruen">Heinrichsgrün</placeName>, <placeName ref="#place-titschendorf">Titschendorf</placeName>, <placeName ref="#place-grumbach">Grumbach</placeName>, <lb n="49" facs="#f0252-l49"/><placeName ref="#place-wurzbach">Wurzbach</placeName>, <placeName ref="#place-siehdichfuer">Siehdichfür</placeName>, <name type="nature" ref="#nature-streitwald">Streitwald</name>, <placeName ref="#place-weidmannsheil">Waidmannsheil</placeName>, <placeName ref="#place-lerchenhuegel">Lerchenhügel</placeName> und <placeName ref="#place-hirschberg">Hirschberg</placeName> <lb n="50" facs="#f0252-l50"/>mit 54,99 Procent der Domanialsforste. Im Jahre 1647 betrug der Domainen<lb n="51" break="no" facs="#f0252-l51"/>wald in den . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . .</p>
<p><note place="foot" n="*)" xml:id="p240-fn1" facs="#f0252-fn1">Die Angaben beruhen bezüglich der Landestheile <placeName ref="#place-gera">Gera</placeName> und <lb n="32" facs="#f0252-l32"/><placeName ref="#place-schleiz">Schleiz</placeName> auf amtlichen Mittheilungen aus <placeName ref="#place-schleiz">Schleiz</placeName>, bezüglich <placeName ref="#place-bezirk-lobenstein-ebersdorf">Lobenstein-Ebersdorf</placeName> auf Mittheilungen aus <lb n="33" facs="#f0252-l33"/>Ebersdorf.</note></p>
</div></body></text>
